    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"unsupported_inference\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Policy debate functions as a generalized rupture in selfhood and social order across the packet.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_3be4d08e76ad5a6a\",\"quote\":\"My right hon. Friend highlights another important aspect of the Bill. When this was first brought to my attention, it seemed strange to me that the use of knives in prisons could not be dealt with in the same manner as the use of knives in other scenarios in public places. As he says, we have done the right thing in bringing that into the Bill The Bill contains a range of measures…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_af60514e69805808\",\"quote\":\"…the criminal justice system is still not keeping up. The challenge from serious crime is increasing, not falling, and more needs to be done. Violent crime is increasing, yet fewer violent crimes are being prosecuted or convicted. More sexual offences are being reported, but fewer are reaching conviction. Reported rapes and domestic violence are increasing, yet fewer are reaching…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_666b48dab21cb06b\",\"quote\":\"Will the right hon. Lady clarify whether the Opposition would support in Committee or on Report measures relating to the disclosure of beneficial ownership…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_e8a977d738a199e9\",\"quote\":\"…criminals from switching their assets to family and friends and getting away with it, and toughening sentences to deal with the problem of people serving only short sentences…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_666b48dab21cb06b\",\"quote\":\"Will the right hon. Lady clarify whether the Opposition would support in Committee or on Report measures relating to the disclosure of beneficial ownership…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_e8a977d738a199e9\",\"quote\":\"…victims of crime right across the country.”\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"The evidence does not support a generalized ‘rupture in selfhood and social order’ resulting from policy debate.\",\"mechanism\":\"The claim makes an expansive, unsupported assertion about the impact of policy debate.\",\"material_consequence\":\"This interpretation ignores the specific, targeted nature of the debate and the measures proposed, failing to acknowledge ongoing systems and processes.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The evidence focuses on specific policy areas and concerns about crime trends, not a fundamental disruption of social order.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The claim presents an overbroad interpretation of the impact of policy debate, failing to account for the specific measures and concerns raised in the provided evidence. The evidence does not support a ‘generalized rupture’ in selfhood and social order.\"}",
    "done": true,
    "done_reason": "stop",
